<title>INDIA: S.AFRICA 58-3 IN 2ND INNINGS TEA 4TH DAY 3RD TEST.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA 58-3 IN 2ND INNINGS TEA 4TH DAY 3RD TEST.</headline>
<dateline>KANPUR, India 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa, chasing a victory target of 461, were 58 for three in their second innings at tea on the fourth day of the third and final test against India on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores:  India 237 and 400-7 declared; South Africa 177 and 58-3.</p>
